       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-KINO-TILE.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-KINO-TILE-PROOFS.
           05  WS-SBP-CONSERVE-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SPATIAL-CARRIER-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MORTON-CONTINUITY-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-KTILE-LATENCY-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-KTILE-SEAL-OK            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-KINO-TILE-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PKT-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PKT-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-SBP-AND-CARRIER.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-MORTON-AND-LAT.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PKT-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-SBP-AND-CARRIER.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SBP-CONSERVE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SPATIAL-CARRIER-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-MORTON-AND-LAT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MORTON-CONTINUITY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-KTILE-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PKT-PROOFS.
           IF WS-SBP-CONSERVE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SPATIAL-CARRIER-OK = 1 AND
              WS-MORTON-CONTINUITY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-KTILE-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-KTILE-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PKT-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PKT-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PKT-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PKT-CODE.
